# Binary audio assets -- override the repo root's blanket `* text eol=lf`
# rule. Without this, git's CRLF normalization would treat these as text
# and mangle raw PCM bytes (any 0x0D 0x0A pair in real audio data) on
# checkout, silently corrupting the vendored drum samples.
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
